OL,3,GNEWSAMcAllan defends description of
OL,4,Acouncil failings in child abuse case as
OL,5,A'catastrophic'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe education secretary has defended
OL,8,Fher description of failings in a major
OL,9,Fchild abuse case as "catastrophic"
OL,10,Fafter a local authority boss took issue
OL,11,Fwith her choice of language.
OL,13,FMairi McAllan said she stood by the
OL,14,Fcomment, which was made in a letter she
OL,15,Fsent to Glasgow City Council chief
OL,16,Fexecutive Susanne Millar.
OL,18,FIt came six days after a review found
OL,19,Fthat social services failed to step in
OL,20,Fand protect three victims of a
OL,21,Fpaedophile gang.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
